Package: craftos-archive-keyring
Version: 0.1
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: nu-stats <j.stowell@northeastern.edu>
Description: CraftOS apt repository signing key and source entry
 Installs the public key that signs the CraftOS apt repository and a
 deb822 sources file pointing at it, so apt full-upgrade delivers new
 Craft app releases and craftos-desktop updates.
